  {
   "id": "whiskey-zombies-117253@major-2021-06-30",
   "gameId": "whiskey-zombies-117253",
   "displayName": "Whiskey & Zombies Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-06-30T14:53:40.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Big ‘ol update with tons of fixes under the hood and a totally revamped and expanded leaderboard. It is also platform-independent now — which means that players on upcoming systems will compete with everyone else. Don’t worry, there’s no crappy aim assist in this game, everyone has the same shitty drunken aim as everyone else... x.O. All current stats on the Steam leaderboards will hopefully transfer over nicely.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have also fixed some of the broken achievements here on Steam and we have added some new achievements — some are public but we have added three hidden ones that come with a prize! First to unlock all three before October 31st 2021 gets something really nifty! Just drop us a line and show us a screencap of your achievements!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "It took a little time to get this one out as we updated to a newer version of Unity, something very NOT advisable during production but we had to do it. Now, we have some more options moving forward for things we’ve wanted to implement for a while. Now, we just need to put down the celebratory bottle(s) long enough to get ‘em done!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Drink. Fight. Stay Alive.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "/Team McCreary",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New platform-independent system",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tons of new leaderboards: [ACHIEVEMENTS & STATS]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed broken achievements by fixing stats not calculating correctly",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "New stats and achievements added",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New hidden achievements added",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "General optimizations",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bug Fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
