  {
   "id": "whiskey-zombies-117253@major-2021-05-24",
   "gameId": "whiskey-zombies-117253",
   "displayName": "Whiskey & Zombies Major Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-05-24T15:32:25.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "We are super stoked to be able to announce Whiskey & Zombies v1.5. This is a major update with not one but two big new features. We are finally bringing a new game mode — Last Hillbilly Standing and a whole new map — The Pits! Here you can settle old scores in some Player vs Player vs Zombies fast-paced action.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The other fun feature is leaderboards! No more arguing over who is the best undead redneck slaying machine. This is available in the demo as well.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And based on your feedback, we have made tons of smaller improvements such as Brighter Levels (so you can see the zombies a little easier) and Enhanced Zombie NPC behavior. There are also tons of optimizations, bug fixes, and quality of life improvements.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We super hope you enjoy this update. Be sure to let us know what you think!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[NEW GAME MODE]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Multiplayer game mode Last Hillbilly Standing added",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Last Hillbilly Standing map added — The Pit",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "First batch of steam leaderboards",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Seperate leaderboards for demo",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Brightness increased in all levels",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Enhanced npc/zombie behaviour",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "General optimizations",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bug Fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
