  {
   "id": "whiskey-zombies-117253@major-2020-12-09",
   "gameId": "whiskey-zombies-117253",
   "displayName": "Whiskey & Zombies Update News",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-12-09T22:10:31.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "So we finally got around to releasing Whiskey & Zombies! Thanks for the amazing response so far, brings joy to our shitkicker hearts. And we super appreciate all the feedback — keep it coming, the good, the bad, and the ugly! We are trying to make this the funniest (and hardest most frustratingly exciting) game possible so any and all input is amazing.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have been making a bunch of small updates over the last weeks to improve the game, and we will continue to do so. We fixed a lot of smaller bugs, multiplayer balancing issues, and quality of life improvements. The biggest thing was that we opened up most of the levels from the start, not just the first. (we keep forgetting that we are old school gamers who are used to the progression aspect…) So enjoy the different kinds of zombie mayhem!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That’s it for now. A lot more fun stuff is just around the corner… or so Zombie Santa tells us ;)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cheers!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Erik McCreary",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
